## 2️⃣ CITATION.cff file

Create a file called `CITATION.cff` in the **root of your repository**:

```yaml
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it using the following BibTeX."
title: "What are You Looking at? Modality Contribution in Multimodal Medical Deep Learning Methods"
authors:
  - family-names: Gapp
    given-names: Christian
  - family-names: Tappeiner
    given-names: Elias
  - family-names: Welk
    given-names: Martin
  - family-names: Fritscher
    given-names: Karl
  - family-names: Gizewski
    given-names: Elke R.
  - family-names: Schubert
    given-names: Rainer
year: 2025
doi: 10.48550/arXiv.2503.01904

